Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:49.78,Title,0,0,0,0,,《夺宝奇兵4：水晶骷髅王国》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.13,0:01:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what you got under there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 咱们赛一赛吗？ - 得了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, you want to race? - Oh, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧！- 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Come on, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.69,0:01:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托了 - 来啊 来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please? - Come on! Let's go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.55,0:02:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go faster! Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:19.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（原子咖啡馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:46.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1957年 美国 内华达州）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为武器测试 整个地区在24小时内禁止通行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole area is closed for weapons testing for the next 24 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:03:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括所有基地的工作人员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That includes all on-base personnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 下午好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对您也不例外 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that goes for you, too, Colonel, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,五角大楼规定…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pentagon sent out revised …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:33.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（禁区 无权进入者格杀勿论）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:28.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国陆军 1B7731 仅供官方使用）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为对付他们很容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't gonna be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好汉不提当年勇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as easy as it used to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还不是最糟的一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've been through worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？那最糟的是哪次？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,昆茨堡那次 当时敌人比我们多一倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flensburg. There was twice as many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那时我们还年轻 - 我仍然很年轻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were younger. - I still am young!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次我们手上有枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手放下 真丢人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands down, will you? You're embarrassing us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准能脱险 我赌五百块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you 500 bucks we can get out of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是赌一百吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's call it 100.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这是哪儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recognize building, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下死者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.17,0:05:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说去死吧 同志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant drop dead, comrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,按住他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.71,0:05:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿找到他们的？ - 墨西哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where was he found? - In Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在夜里挖宝 找这些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were digging in the dirt, looking for this stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是本地人 是不是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not from around here, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 你不会想知道我是哪里人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it you would imagine I am from, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你那副不可一世的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the way you're sinking your teeth into those wubble-u's, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你是来自乌克兰东部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should think maybe Eastern Ukraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高的评价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highest marks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是艾琳娜·史波可博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Dr. Irina Spalko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我获得过列宁勋章 三次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times I have received Order of Lenin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及英雄的社会主义劳动者奖章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also medal as Hero of Socialist Labor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我无所不知 我知人所未知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know things. I know them before anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且若我不知 我会查出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what I do not know, I find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我现在想知道的 就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what I need to know now is in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琼斯博士 你很难感知嘛 - 好痛呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are a hard man to read, Dr. Jones. - Ouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们只好按老规矩办事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we will do this, what is expression, old-fashioned way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.61,0:07:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样你就会帮我们找到想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will tell us. You will help us find what we seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门打开{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间仓库就是你们政府存放所有秘密的地方吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This warehouse is where you and your government have hidden all of your secrets, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是间军用仓库 我此前从没来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a military warehouse. I've never been here before in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找的东西装在长方形盒子内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Object we seek, rectangular storage container, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,盒子长2米 宽0.5米 厚66厘米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}dimensions 2 meters by 0.5 meter by 66 centimeters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面装的是具遗骸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contents of box, mummified remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不知此事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no doubt familiar to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为我会知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think I've got any idea what box you're talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在十年前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because 10 years ago …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你带领小组找到它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were part of the team that examined it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你说的是什么了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I knew what you were talking about …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要帮我们找到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will help us find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.02,0:08:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,指南针 我需要个指南针{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compass. I need a compass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是用来指北 南 东…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, north, south, east West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, north, south, east West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没指南针吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No compass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的子弹给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 他要我把枪给他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个盒子有极高的磁性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The contents of that box are highly magnetized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我火药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need gunpowder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想要我帮你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want my help or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和我耍花招 琼斯博士 你到底在搞什么鬼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't toy with me, Dr. Jones. What is the point of all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那盒子依然具有磁性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's still magnetic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这火药中的铁屑会指引方向的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the metal in this gunpowder should point the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.73,0:09:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹壳 给我些散弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shells. Give me some shotgun shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,钳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pliers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,同志们 找到了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来几个人把它抬出来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿 小心{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:11:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力 小心 稳住 稳住{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:04.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新墨西哥州 罗斯威尔 1947年 编号RSW001）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我把刀{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀 给您{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于找到了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪都放下！不然史波可博士就死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the guns, or Colonel Dr. Spalko is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Mac?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯 要我怎么说呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what can I say, Jonesey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信奉资本主义 而他们出价不低{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a capitalist, and they pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年来 我们同甘共苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all those years we spent spying on the Reds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我们是朋友呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were friends, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是我不幸被他们抓住的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a run of bad luck with the cards lately, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕 太他妈可怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awful. Bloody awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再两手空空地回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go home empty-handed again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.99,0:14:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 想好遗言了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No defiant last words, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我热爱考古{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like Ike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下就放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.82,0:14:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 就差一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, I thought that was closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.45,0:14:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能活着离开这儿 派人去截住他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 鲍里斯 你不了解情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get clever, Boris. You don't know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know him. Know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没搞清楚 你不了解他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know him! You don't know him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解他 你不了解他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know him! You don't know …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干得不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿酷极了！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 有人在家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我过敲门了 你们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I knocked. You guys got a …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that can't be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人注意 一分钟内撤离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel, it is now one minute to zero time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.27,0:19:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴好墨镜 向相反方向撤离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on goggles or turn away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第一次闪光后十秒内 不要摘掉墨镜回头看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not remove goggles or face burst until 10 seconds after first light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大事不妙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't be good at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.07,0:19:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退 我们快走！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait! Wait, wait, wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.21,0:20:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他妈的 不等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure! Great! Don't wait for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,15秒倒计时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minus 15 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,10秒倒计时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minus 10 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,九 八 七 六{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niner, eight, seven, six, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fiver, four, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一 发射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}three, two, one, zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.25,0:22:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不知道麦克是间谍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no reason to believe that Mac was a spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为战略情报局工作时 他为军情六处工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was Ml6 when I was in OSS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在欧洲和太平洋地区 我们合作过二三十次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did 20, 30 missions together in Europe and the Pacific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.80,0:22:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在我们面前显摆你的功绩了 琼斯上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wave your war record in our face, Colonel Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都曾为国效力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all served.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.31,0:22:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？你们站在那一边的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kidding? What side were you on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你已经认识到局势的严重性了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you recognize the gravity of your situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚协助克格勃特务侵入了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aided and abetted KGB agents who broke into a top-secret military installation …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们国家中部的秘密军事基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the middle of the United States of America, my country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.32,0:22:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,被窃的那个钢盒里是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was in the steel box they took?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.36,0:22:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个应该你告诉我们 你以前见过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell us. You've seen it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.54,0:22:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指47年的那次任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean that Air Force fiasco in '47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被塞进一辆密不透风的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was tossed into a bus with blacked-out windows …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不许和同车的20人说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 20 people I wasn't allowed to speak to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,半夜出发去执行紧急挖掘任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hauled out in the middle of the night in the middle of nowhere …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道去哪儿 而又能看到什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on some urgent recovery project and shown what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.47,0:23:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无遮掩的具有强磁性的碎片 还有不同寻常的遗迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pieces of wreckage and an intensely magnetic shroud covering mutilated remains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.39,0:23:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁都不知道那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us was ever given the full picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,并被威胁如果和任何人说起 就会被处以叛国罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we were threatened with treason if we ever talked about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以应该是你们告诉我 那盒子里到底装的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you tell me, what was in the box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.07,0:23:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.48,0:23:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道躲在冰箱里有多危险吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know it's dangerous to climb into a refrigerator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.82,0:23:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些东西可能正是陷阱呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things can be deathtraps!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好 鲍勃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you, too, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 伙计们 我来和琼斯博士谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, boys. I can vouch for Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.62,0:23:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,克格勃跑到美国本土来了 那女人是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}KGB on American soil? Who is that woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,描述一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Describe her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.29,0:23:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,又高又瘦 三十多岁 还带着把破剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tall, thin, mid-30s, carried a sword of some kind, a rapier, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.26,0:23:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定她在此地？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure she's here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.93,0:23:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了又走了 她是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here and gone. Who is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.39,0:23:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳娜·史波可 她是斯大林的干女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irina Spalko, she was Stalin's fair-haired girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.06,0:23:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是著名科学家 如果通灵术也算是科学的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His favorite scientist, if you can call psychic research science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯将军…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Ross …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.19,0:23:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她率领队伍转战世界各地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's leading teams from the Kremlin all over the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.53,0:23:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处搜集她认为有军事价值的古物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scooping up artifacts she thinks might have paranormal military applications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.53,0:24:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗斯将军 - 闭嘴 保罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- General Ross! - Back off, Paul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.57,0:24:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是每个人都是共产党间谍 印第更不会是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone in the Army's a Commie and certainly not Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了没被核弹炸死外 对我还有什么指控吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly am I being accused of, besides surviving a nuclear blast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.71,0:24:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前还没有指控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.88,0:24:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但老实说 鉴于你同乔治·麦克希尔的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But frankly your association with George McHale …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,使你在二战时的行为有些可疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes all your activities suspicious, including those during the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.21,0:24:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you nuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.22,0:24:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这帮杂种还要多少这样的金属吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how many medals this son of a bitch won?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.55,0:24:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great many, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.72,0:24:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们受之有愧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But does he deserve them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.39,0:24:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 你现在对政府很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, let's just say for now that you are of interest to the Bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.48,0:24:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,至关重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of great interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.53,0:24:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grooved Ware in the beginning of modern drainage practices, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.37,0:24:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在苏格兰斯卡拉布雷遗址也被发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we also see in Skara Brae on the west coast of Scotland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,该遗址可以追溯到公元前3100年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skara Brae dates from 3100 B.C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.63,0:24:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,六百年来 它一直被占领着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was continuously occupied for 600 years …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,直至公元前2500年被遗弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until it was apparently abandoned in 2500 B.C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.38,0:24:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还没有令人信服的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no clear evidence as to why its occupants …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.59,0:25:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,表明为何占领者决定放弃一个完美的生存环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}decided to abandon a perfectly healthy environment. Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.51,0:25:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能打扰一下吗 教授？ - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I have a moment, Professor? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开书 复习第四章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up Michaelson. Review Chapter 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.56,0:25:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿我回来后 我们讨论迁徙和「出埃及」的不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I come back we'll discuss the difference between migration and exodus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.86,0:25:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.82,0:25:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 学校董事会不停施压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea the pressure coming from the Board of Regents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.70,0:25:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局今早来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI showed up this morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.12,0:25:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜遍了你的办公室 查抄了所有文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ransacked your office, searched all your files!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.79,0:25:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是在学校啊 你怎么不阻止他们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the dean of the college. Why didn't you stop them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.71,0:25:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没这个权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have no right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.04,0:25:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全有这个权利 他们是群畜生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had every right! They weren't vandals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.54,0:25:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是带着搜查令的特务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were federal agents with search warrants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.05,0:25:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校不会冒险卷入此类麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The university isn't gonna get itself embroiled in that kind of controversy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.59,0:25:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这种情况更不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not in this charged climate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.76,0:25:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这就是要开除我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're firing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是让你暂时离职 没别的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A leave of absence is all. An indefinite leave of absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.64,0:25:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是开除 - 此间…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are firing me. - During which …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.27,0:25:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还会付你全额的工资…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've agreed to continue to pay your full salary for a period …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.19,0:25:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要他们的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want their money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.73,0:26:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你别犯傻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't be foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.32,0:26:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我费了多大劲才给你争取到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what I had to go through to get that for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.32,0:26:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还费劲儿？你又能费什么劲 查理？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went through? What exactly did you have to go through, Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.66,0:26:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.16,0:26:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我辞职了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I resigned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.75,0:26:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.88,0:26:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,先去纽约 明早去伦敦 重新开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train to New York, overnight to London, for starts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.68,0:26:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我不去莱比锡大学呢？他们的校长欠我人情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might end up teaching in Leipzig. Heinrich owes me a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.06,0:26:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我定居下来 我就给你写信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wire you when I get settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.52,0:26:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再把剩下的东西给我寄过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can send on the rest of my things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.35,0:26:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时东西早被搜光了 都不用寄了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose there's nothing to keep you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.56,0:26:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个国家已经面目全非了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely recognize this country anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.61,0:26:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府总是怀疑我们是共产党{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government's got us seeing Communists in our soup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.78,0:26:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当疯狂战胜科学时 换换工作也不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the hysteria reaches academia, I guess it's time to call it a career.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.41,0:26:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪尔丽德怎么受得了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did Deirdre take the news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.53,0:26:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,妻子通常都是怎么接受的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does any wife take such things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.91,0:26:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着丈夫的脸 混杂着自豪与惊恐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The look on her face was a combination of pride and panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.16,0:26:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该怀疑你的 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should've doubted you, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.21,0:27:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 这几天你怀疑朋友也可以理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you have reason to question your friends these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.55,0:27:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了好几年了 查理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brutal couple of years, huh, Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.97,0:27:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是爸爸 然后是马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Dad, then Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.73,0:27:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到年纪啦 生活不再给予而是开始带走我们的挚爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We seem to have reached the age where life stops giving us things and starts taking them away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.57,0:27:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,再喝半杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another half glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.92,0:28:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.96,0:28:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, old man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.63,0:28:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 教授 喂 你是琼斯博士吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, hello! Hey! Are you Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.76,0:28:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,火车快出站了 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're running out of platform, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是奥克斯利教授的朋友吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a friend of Dr. Oxley's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.93,0:28:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是那个考古学家哈洛德·奥克斯利吗？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Harold Oxley? The archeologist? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.39,0:28:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.98,0:28:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有生命危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.86,0:28:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有20年没同他说话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't talked to Harold Oxley in 20 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.24,0:28:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个出色的学者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a brilliant guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.57,0:28:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那种能把你说得昏昏欲睡的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could put you to sleep just by talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.53,0:28:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 很多孩子听他说话都会睡着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. When I was a kid, that's how I did get to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.70,0:29:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的声音比牛奶还催眠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxley's voice was better than a glass of warm milk, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.71,0:29:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫马特·威廉姆斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Mutt, Mutt Williams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.75,0:29:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特？怎么取这个名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutt? What kind of name is that? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.01,0:29:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 你找揍吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the one I picked. You got a problem with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.13,0:29:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点儿 你和奥力克斯博士有什么关系？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. What was your relationship to Oxley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.51,0:29:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爹死于二战 他帮助我妈抚养我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad died in the war. Ox kind of helped my mom raise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.10,0:29:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是有人要取他性命？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying somebody's going to kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.73,0:29:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个月前 我妈收到奥克斯的来信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months ago, my mom gets a letter from the Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.15,0:29:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他在秘鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's down in Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.69,0:29:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了什么骷髅头 水晶骷髅头骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found some type of skull, a crystal skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.49,0:29:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个叫米切尔-哈提基思什么的人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the one that guy Mitchell-Hodgkiss? Hedgkiss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.20,0:29:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是他发现的那个 - 外套不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The one he found. - Nice jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.54,0:29:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学里只有奥克斯和我研究水晶骷髅头骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ox and I were obsessed with the Mitchell-Hedges skull in college.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.04,0:29:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.29,0:29:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢？他成天只说这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding? It's all he talked about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.67,0:29:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一回家就说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd talk about that thing till the cows come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.55,0:29:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个神秘雕像吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it? It's like an idol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.55,0:29:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,做工精美 在美洲中部被发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deity carving. Mesoamerican.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.43,0:29:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上有很多水晶骷髅头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a number of crystal skulls in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.64,0:29:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在大英博物馆见过一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw one in the British Museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.72,0:30:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣的水晶赝品 没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting craftsmanship, but that's about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.43,0:30:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们等会再谈那个 奥克斯说这次他找到真的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, laugh if you want. Oxley said he found it this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.35,0:30:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且要将其还于埃克托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said this was real and he was off to a place called Akator with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.40,0:30:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃克托？你确定他是这么说的吗？ - 我确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Akator? He said that? You're sure? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.24,0:30:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你刚说的一样 你说埃克托 那是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he said. He said Akator. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.99,0:30:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是亚马孙河流域传说中的失落之城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mythical lost city in the Amazon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,西班牙探险者称之为「黄金国」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conquistadors called it El Dorado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.75,0:30:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说是神选的布伽族人在七千年前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposedly, the Ugha tribe were chosen by the gods 7, 000 years ago …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.92,0:30:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,以实心金砖建造的巨大的城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to build a giant city out of solid gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.75,0:30:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,其建筑的工艺水平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had aqueducts and paved roads …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.42,0:30:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,建造技术在之后五千年内再未出现过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and technology that wouldn't be seen again for 5, 000 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.60,0:30:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科·尤里奥纳于1546年到亚马逊探索该城未果而失踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francisco de Orellana disappeared into the Amazon looking for it in 1546.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.60,0:30:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾试图寻找它 但险些丧命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost died of typhus looking for it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.11,0:30:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信它存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.57,0:30:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么奥克斯要把骷髅头带到那去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Ox want to take the skull there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.53,0:30:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,据传说 骷髅头于15或16世纪时被人从埃克托窃走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legend says that a crystal skull was stolen from Akator in the 15th or 16th century, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.45,0:31:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论谁 若能将它归还城市神庙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that whoever returns the skull to the city temple …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.16,0:31:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为报答将会掌控某种力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be given control over its power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.46,0:31:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量？关系到了某种力量 是什么样的力量？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power. Right. So there's some kind of power. What's the power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.38,0:31:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 孩子 只是个传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, kid. It's just a story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.55,0:31:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.59,0:31:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈收到奥克斯的信之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From his letter, my mom thought the Ox was off his rocker. You know, smog in the noggin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.93,0:31:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就去找他 而他已经被绑架了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she goes down there to find him, only he'd already been kidnapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.31,0:31:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们也抓住了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they've got her, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.14,0:31:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯说他们在某个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Ox said he hid that skull someplace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.68,0:31:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈要是不能提供有用的信息 他们两人都会没命的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if my mom doesn't come up with it, they're gonna kill them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.02,0:31:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你能帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, she said you'd help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.90,0:31:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？令堂的名字是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? What's your mom's name again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.15,0:31:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽安·威廉姆斯 你还记得她吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary. Mary Williams. You remember her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.99,0:31:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识许多叫玛丽安的人 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were a lot of Marys, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.32,0:31:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,住口 你说的可是我老妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! That's my mother you're talking about!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.53,0:31:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我母亲 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? That's my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.41,0:31:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不必拍桌子瞪眼的 来让自己显得像个硬汉吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to get sore all the time just to prove how tough you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.49,0:31:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 请坐下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down. Please. Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.00,0:31:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你能找到骷髅头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said if anybody could find the skull, it's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个…盗墓贼什么的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you're some type of … Like a grave robber or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.67,0:31:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是考古学的终身教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a tenured professor of archeology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.59,0:32:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你是老师 那就更能帮我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're a teacher. Well, that's gonna be a big help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.93,0:32:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我妈两周前从南美打电话给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, she called me two weeks ago from South America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.02,0:32:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,说她逃出来了 他们在追她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said she'd escaped, but they were after her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.60,0:32:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有封奥克斯转给你的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she'd just gotten a letter from the Ox …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.35,0:32:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我转交给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and mailed it to me so I could give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.44,0:32:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话就断了 我拆开看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the line went dead. I opened it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.90,0:32:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但看不懂 乱码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the thing's pointless, though. It's just gibberish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.44,0:32:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是用英文写的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even English lettering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.90,0:32:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.91,0:32:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那两个盯梢的了吧？ 在桌旁的那两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See those two bricks over there, at the counter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.33,0:32:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可不是来喝奶昔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think they're here for the milkshakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.00,0:32:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.29,0:32:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 可能是调查局的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. Maybe FBI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.29,0:32:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别轻举妄动 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come quietly, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.13,0:32:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明他们是克格勃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that KGB.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.63,0:32:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把信交出来 - 信？什么信？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And bring letter with you. - Letter? What letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.80,0:32:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是威廉姆斯先生刚给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letter Mr. Williams just give you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.22,0:32:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？我看起来像个邮递员吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Do I look like a mailman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.22,0:32:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会再说一次了 现在就跟我们走 不然…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't ask again. Come now or we'll …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.05,0:32:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.31,0:32:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错的尝试 孩子 但我看你是带了把刀去参加枪战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, kid, but I think you just brought a knife to a gunfight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.23,0:32:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.32,0:32:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 揍这小子 - 揍谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hit this guy. - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.57,0:33:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,正要结帐出去这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe College. Hit him hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.11,0:33:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好啊 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, hold this. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.07,0:33:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我男朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boyfriend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.91,0:33:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍这帮飚车党{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that greaser!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.47,0:33:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你妈逃出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom didn't escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.97,0:33:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们放了她 好让她把信寄给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They let her go, so she could mail the letter …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.85,0:33:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让你把信给我 我就可以破译它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you could bring it to me and I could translate it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.12,0:33:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 他们要跑了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.27,0:33:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on, gramps!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.55,0:34:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！快！快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.52,0:34:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他 抓住他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.86,0:34:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拐弯了 跟上{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.85,0:34:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.75,0:35:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那儿 跟上{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.62,0:35:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,宁死不红 宁死不红{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better dead than Red! Better dead than Red!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.05,0:35:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是疯了 有人会受伤的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy! Somebody's going to get hurt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.86,0:35:40.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马库斯·布鲁迪）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿 跟上他们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.54,0:35:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,向左拐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left! Go left! Left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.39,0:36:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.89,0:36:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 闪开 闪开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split, split! Split, split!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.27,0:36:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们开得太快了 - 只有你觉得快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're going too fast. - That's a matter of opinion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.83,0:36:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打扰一下 琼斯博士 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, Dr. Jones. - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于哈格罗伍的文化图腾 我有个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a question on Hargrove's normative culture model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.17,0:36:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是算了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget Hargrove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.63,0:36:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去查阅范戈登·蔡尔德的著作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read Vere Gordon Childe on diffusionism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.80,0:36:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这个领域钻研了一辈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spent most of his life in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.97,0:36:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,若想成为个优秀的考古学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to be a good archeologist, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.09,0:36:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得走出图书馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got to get out of the library!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.44,0:37:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.56,0:37:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯科·迪·尤里奥纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francisco de Orellana, the conquistador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.77,0:37:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾说过他在寻找骷髅头时失踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, the guy who got lost looking for the skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.11,0:37:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我所猜测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just as I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.70,0:37:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「科尤玛」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koihoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.78,0:37:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.32,0:37:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是种失传的拉丁美洲语言 索拉比克语的语源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an extinct Latin American language. Pre-Columbian syllabic base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.58,0:37:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 虽然字体不同 但线条差不多 绝对是科尤玛语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See. Diagonal stresses on the ideograms. Definitely Koihoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.71,0:37:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会说这种语言吗？ - 没人会说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You speak it? - Nobody speaks it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.67,0:37:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,3千年来 听到这种语言的人都不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hasn't been heard aloud in 3, 000 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.09,0:37:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我能看懂一点 不过得先复习一下玛雅语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be able to read a bit though if I walk it through Mayan first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.18,0:37:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一个老家伙来说 你打架一点都不逊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for an old man, you ain't bad in a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.72,0:37:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢夸奖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.56,0:37:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有八十岁了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, like, 80?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.90,0:37:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个谜语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a riddle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.15,0:37:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很符合奥克斯的风格 用消亡了的语言写成谜语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it to Ox to write a riddle in a dead language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.20,0:37:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「跟随地球上那条只有上帝才能看到的线」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Follow the lines in the earth only gods can read …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.37,0:38:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「指引你找到有活死人守护着的尤里奥纳的摇篮」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"which lead to Orellana's cradle guarded by the living dead."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.87,0:38:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说的是纳兹卡线 - 什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's talking about the Nazca Lines. - What are those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.87,0:38:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.00,0:38:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨大而古老的地表图画雕刻在秘鲁沙漠的地面上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geoglyphs. Giant ancient drawings carved into the desert floor in Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.55,0:38:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地上看是看不出什么名堂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the ground, they don't look like anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.39,0:38:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是从空中 只有上帝可懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But from the sky, only the gods can read them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.10,0:38:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只有上帝高高在上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because only gods live up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.89,0:38:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯利想告诉我们 骷髅就在秘鲁的纳兹卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxley's telling us the skull is in Nazca, Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.96,0:39:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于知道有人看见过他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally. They saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.17,0:39:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯几个月前来过 像个疯子似的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox wandered into town a couple of months ago, raving like a madman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.13,0:39:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察把他关进修道院 走这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police locked him up in the sanitarium. It's this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.64,0:39:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说的西班牙语 我一个字都不懂 那到底是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took Spanish and I didn't understand a word of that. What was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.14,0:39:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「卡图瓦」 当地土话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quechua, local Incan dialect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.43,0:39:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么学会的？ - 说来话长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you learn that one? - Long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.10,0:39:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有的是时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.77,0:39:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和「庞驰·维拉」待过 他的手下会这种话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rode with Pancho Villa. A couple of his guys spoke it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.27,0:39:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯谈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.02,0:39:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你问我的 - 庞驰·维拉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You asked. - Pancho Villa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 实际上 我是被绑架去的 - 被庞驰·维拉的人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Technically, I was kidnapped. - By Pancho Villa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.61,0:40:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在与维克多瑞亚·胡塔的交战中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the fight against Victoriano Huerta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.16,0:40:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那时你多大？ - 那时我就你这么大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old were you? - About your age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.45,0:40:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母肯定急疯了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents must've had a cow, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.04,0:40:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时和家人的关系有点紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked out. Things were a little tense at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.29,0:40:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和老妈相处得也不是很融洽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me and my mom aren't on the best of terms, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.25,0:40:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 要知道你只会有一个妈 而且也不能陪你一生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treat her right, kid. You only get one and sometimes not for that long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.80,0:40:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不是我的错 是她的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault. It's hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.17,0:40:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她勃然大怒 因为我退学了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just got P.O.'ed because I quit school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.88,0:40:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为我是个一事无成的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks I'm some kind of goof or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.47,0:40:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你退学了？ - 没错 还不只一次呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You quit school? - Oh, yeah. Sure. Tons of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.76,0:40:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在几所有名的预科学校读过书 学辩论 国际象棋 剑术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy prep schools that teach you how to debate and chess and fencing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.77,0:40:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不相信什么学位呢 那只是浪费时间而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm great with the blade. I just think it's a waste of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.02,0:40:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从没读完 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You never finished. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.19,0:40:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只学了一些无用的技能罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a bunch of useless skills. Wrong books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.90,0:40:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我喜欢阅读 我过去整天都看书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I love reading. Me and Ox used to read all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.36,0:40:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我能证明自己了 相信吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I can pick them myself. You get me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.86,0:40:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从哪儿来的钱？ - 参加摩托车赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you do for money? - Fix motorcycles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一辈子都准备干这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna do that for the rest of your life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.37,0:40:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我会的 你觉得不好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I will, Teach. You got a problem with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.04,0:40:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只要是你喜欢做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not if that's what you love doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.54,0:40:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别管别人怎么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let anybody tell you different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.50,0:40:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.19,0:41:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说奥克斯原来就在儿 现在不知去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says Ox isn't here. She doesn't know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.78,0:41:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人来抓走了他 一些拿着枪的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some men came and took him away, men with guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.08,0:41:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说他着魔了 神经错乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says he was obsessed, deranged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.08,0:41:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把监牢的墙上画满图片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drew pictures all over the walls of his cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.75,0:41:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯信中的谜语一点道理都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This riddle in Oxley's letter doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.26,0:41:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「跟随只有上帝才能看见的线」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Follow the lines that only the gods can read "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.00,0:41:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,「它会引领你到尤里奥纳的摇篮」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}" that lead to Orellana's cradle."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.01,0:41:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇篮 他的出生地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cradle, cradle, birth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.39,0:41:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤里奥纳不是生于秘鲁 而是在西班牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orellana wasn't born in Peru. He was born in Spain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.48,0:41:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是探险者 来这儿是为了黄金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a conquistador. He came here for the gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他后来怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.98,0:41:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和其它六名队员 活不见人死不见尸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He disappeared along with six others. Their bodies were never found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.47,0:42:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have lost his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.31,0:42:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么？奥克斯到底怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox, man, what happened? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.41,0:42:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不是米切尔·哈提斯基的骷髅头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the Mitchell-Hedges skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.62,0:42:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 后脑线条较长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the elongated cranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.75,0:42:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不同的语言一遍遍写着相同的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the same word in different languages, over and over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.20,0:42:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,归还 回归{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.51,0:43:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,回返{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.34,0:43:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,返回哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.18,0:43:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者归还什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or return what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.30,0:43:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是骷髅头？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the skull?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.89,0:43:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,萦绕在他脑海中的事物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems to have been on his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.52,0:43:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能是那东西该归还给谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was he supposed to return it to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.53,0:43:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扫干净 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweep. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.75,0:43:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯说的不是尤里奥纳的出生地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox didn't mean Orellana's birthplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.50,0:43:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「摇篮」在玛雅语中还有另一个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cradle has another meaning in Mayan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.01,0:43:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,直译为安息地 和坟墓是一个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally, it means "resting place, " as in final resting place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.05,0:43:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯是说 尤里奥纳的墓地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox meant Orellana's grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.56,0:43:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿了 他就埋葬于此处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This drawing scratched into the floor is the cemetery where he's buried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.06,0:43:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过尤里奥纳蒸发了 没人找到过他的坟墓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said Orellana vanished and nobody ever found his grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.73,0:44:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来老奥克斯利找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks like Harold Oxley did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.43,0:44:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗墓贼会大吃一惊的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Grave robbers will be shot."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.60,0:44:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好在我们不是盗墓贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing we're not grave robbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.53,0:44:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要找什么？ - 还不知道呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we looking for? - I don't know yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.24,0:44:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是这众多墓穴中的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe an antechamber off one of these barrows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.47,0:45:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才好像看见什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just saw something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.14,0:45:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是疑神疑鬼啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're jumping at shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.10,0:45:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这儿下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.90,0:45:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从这儿上来 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way up. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.80,0:45:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,镖上有毒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those darts are poison!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.39,0:46:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,待着别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.29,0:46:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是老师？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a teacher?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.13,0:46:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,兼职的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part-time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.47,0:46:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,死路一条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.89,0:46:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.78,0:46:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？放下那东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Put that thing away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.11,0:46:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我照亮点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some light over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.50,0:47:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.25,0:47:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.07,0:48:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胆子好小 一惊一乍的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dance on your own dime, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.69,0:48:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才被蝎子叮了一下 不会没命吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the scorpions just stung me! Am I gonna die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.82,0:48:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多大一只？ - 巨大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How big? - Huge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.03,0:48:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 这还好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - Good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.03,0:48:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到蝎子 越大毒性越小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it comes to scorpions, the bigger the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.99,0:48:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是小蝎子咬了你 就一定要告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small one bites you, don't keep it to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.27,0:48:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,骷髅 看这些骷髅 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their skulls. Look at their skulls, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.48,0:48:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,和牢房墙上画的如出一辙 说明离得不远了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the drawings in Oxley's cell. Means we're getting closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.19,0:48:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真疯狂 头骨怎么会变成这形状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy. Why is it like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.36,0:49:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地土人用布条缠绑婴儿的头部 使颅骨变形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazca Indians used to bind their infants' heads with rope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.87,0:49:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了现在这模样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to elongate the skull like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.58,0:49:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 敬奉诸神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Honor the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.29,0:49:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 神灵的脑袋长得可不像这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. God's head is not like that, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.62,0:49:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁又知道神长啥样呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on who your god is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.80,0:49:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道去哪 还走这么快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going nowhere fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.85,0:49:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 这儿真的是死路一条啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, this really is a dead end. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.53,0:49:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.84,0:49:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吧 天才 把背包给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, genius. Bring the backpack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.52,0:50:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太难以置信了 - 真的假的啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is incredible. - Unreal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.11,0:50:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别乱动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.20,0:50:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚印 有人来过这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Footprints. Somebody's been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.16,0:50:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.67,0:50:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两种脚印{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two sets of prints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.76,0:50:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看大小 也许同一个人来了两回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same size, could have been the same person twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.63,0:50:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.14,0:50:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One. Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.86,0:51:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 四 五 六{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three. Four. Five. Six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.99,0:51:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,七{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.07,0:51:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤里奥纳和他的人看来根本就没到达雨林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orellana and his men might've made it out of the jungle after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.54,0:51:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,照亮一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.50,0:51:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随身带着刀 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a knife, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.19,0:51:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像昨天才死的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he just died yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.07,0:51:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,裹尸布让他们保存完好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the wrappings. They preserved him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.42,0:51:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What just happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.54,0:52:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,被包裹了500年 接触空气可不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been wrapped up for 500 years. Air doesn't agree with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.18,0:52:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.89,0:52:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想借这把刀去使使已经好多年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to keep borrowing yours all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.85,0:52:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这没什么 - 还是还给他吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's fine. - I was going to put it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.57,0:52:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这具尸骸也被人打开了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this one open already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.67,0:52:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.34,0:52:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尤里奥纳本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Orellana himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.56,0:53:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,散发着金子般光芒的男人 因传说中的黄金而失去踪影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called him The Gilded Man. His lust for gold was legendary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.61,0:53:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不幸啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.74,0:53:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了又走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's been here and gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.24,0:53:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但黄金 所有器物还在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they left all this gold and all the artifacts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.33,0:53:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要找的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were they looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.64,0:53:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿着 - 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold this. - No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.87,0:53:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不可思议了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.80,0:54:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼斧神工 浑然天成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tool marks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.71,0:54:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,由一块材料雕刻而成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single piece of seamless quartz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.13,0:54:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把大脑分成两个半球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut across the grain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.85,0:54:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使今日的科技也无法做到这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not possible, even with today's technology, it would shatter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.48,0:54:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,水晶没有磁性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crystal's not magnetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.61,0:54:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是金子做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither is gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.07,0:54:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.83,0:54:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许当地土人认为这就是他们的神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the Nazca Indians thought this was their god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.04,0:54:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为这个就是从… - 埃克托城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think this is the one from … - From Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.55,0:54:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这些西班牙佬发现了骷髅头和其它的珍宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the Spaniards found this skull along with all this other loot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.22,0:54:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,便朝海边的舰队走去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were headed for their ships along the shore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.05,0:55:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许印第安人发现并杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the Indians caught up with them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.10,0:55:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者西班牙人起了内讧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they got to squabbling amongst themselves …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.73,0:55:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,相互残杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over their prize, kill each other off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.27,0:55:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安人将他们包裹安葬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Indians wrap them up and bury them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.61,0:55:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百年后 奥克斯利来到此处找到骷髅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of hundred years later, Oxley shows up here, finds the skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.78,0:55:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,将其带走 也许带到了埃克托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes it away, maybe to Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.08,0:55:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他随即又返回了此地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then he returns it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.66,0:55:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,返回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.46,0:55:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,「返回」 和监牢墙上的字是一个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return, like he wrote on the walls of his cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.42,0:55:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将此物归还 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put it back where he found it. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.62,0:56:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好啊 琼斯 - 你好 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Jonesey. - Hello, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.03,0:56:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯 你能坐在这儿真惬意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky I turned up, Jonesey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.99,0:56:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的歌舞让我头都快炸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dovchenko there wanted to blow your brains out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.32,0:56:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天都三次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the third time I've saved your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.95,0:56:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,松开手拷 我好给你个大拥抱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unshackle me. I'll give you a big hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.16,0:56:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时有手枪啊 为什么束手就擒啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a Luger pointed at the base of your skull the first time we met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.00,0:56:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都在我控制之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the situation under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.96,0:56:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你欠我的情 - 那你欠他们什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You owe me. - What do you owe them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.80,0:56:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,二战结束后你就叛变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the war, when you turned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.09,0:56:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了苏军多少名单？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how many names did you give the Reds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.34,0:57:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有多少人因为你命丧黄泉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not looking at the big picture here. How many good men died because of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.89,0:57:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮共军终究会放开我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually, they're gonna let me out of this chair, comrade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.27,0:57:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时看我怎么打断你鼻子吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when they do, I'm going to break your nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.73,0:57:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,共军？你以为这是因为意识形态？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Comrade"? You think this is about flags?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.15,0:57:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了地图上的线？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About uniforms? You think this is about lines on a map?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.61,0:57:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是为了钱 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just about money, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.48,0:57:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的才不是钱呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not only money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.36,0:57:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是堆积如山的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gigantic pile of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.53,0:57:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想埃克托藏着的宝物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about what the Russians will pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.04,0:57:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才看不上苏军付我的小钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing compared to what's at Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.25,0:57:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一座黄金城 那才是我们的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entire city of gold. It's what the conquistadors were after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.88,0:57:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 琼斯 我们快发财了 比谁都有钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, Jonesey, we'd be rich! Richer than Howard Hughes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.63,0:57:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一分钱上都沾满了鲜血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood money, every nickel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.22,0:57:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会就此放过你的 哥们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to see the angle here, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.51,0:57:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,放聪明点 做该做的事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be smart. Do the right thing. Just like in …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.23,0:57:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得在柏林吗？懂我的意思没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like in Berlin. Got me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.90,0:57:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就和在柏林一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like in Berlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.07,0:57:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我出去是吧 去看歌舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to trot off, or should we sing a song?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.49,0:58:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好当初没杀你 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fortunate our failure to kill you, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.37,0:58:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又为我们服务了一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You survive to be of service to us once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.45,0:58:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解我的 总是助人为乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know me, always glad to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.50,0:58:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌控死亡的力量才会摧毁这世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Now I am become death, the destroyer of worlds."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.92,0:58:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得这些话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recognize those words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.76,0:58:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,出自你们的奥本海默博士 在他制造了原子弹之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was your own Dr. Oppenheimer after he created the atomic bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.26,0:58:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是在引用印度教的圣经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was quoting the Hindu bible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.76,0:58:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显是威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was nuclear intimidation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.93,0:58:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我们唾手可得更高级的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now this next level of weapon is ours to have, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.02,0:58:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该轮到你们恐惧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}yours to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.02,0:58:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器？什么样的武器？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapon? What weapon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.61,0:58:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神控制武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mind weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.44,0:58:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,心理战的阵地 斯大林的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new frontier of psychic warfare. That was Stalin's dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.95,0:58:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我可明白奥力克斯为何要把骷髅放回原处了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know why Oxley put the skull back where he found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.08,0:58:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你们在找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew you were looking for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.41,0:58:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必你一见骷髅就知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That skull is no mere deity carving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.50,0:58:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那简直巧夺天工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you knew that the moment you laid eyes on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.62,0:58:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝非出自人手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not made by human hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.75,0:58:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁做的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who made it, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.76,0:59:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.68,0:59:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在新墨西哥州找到的尸骸不是第一具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The body we found in New Mexico was not the first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.64,0:59:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在苏联的几处地方也有相同发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd already dissected two others from similar crash sites in Soviet Union.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.60,0:59:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,火星来客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saucer men from Mars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.43,0:59:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于埃克托的古老传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legends about Akator are all true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.65,0:59:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,古人是想象不出来的 更不要说建造出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early men could not have conceived it, much less built it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.15,0:59:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一座高等生物的城池{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a city of supreme beings …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.40,0:59:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们技术发达 拥有超常能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with technologies and paranormal abilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.57,0:59:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这玩笑可开大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.03,0:59:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看吧 信不信由你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you choose not to believe your own eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.83,0:59:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,新墨西哥州找到的样本 让我们充满希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The New Mexico specimen gave us hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.00,0:59:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有其它样本 骸骨都是由纯水晶制成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike the others we'd found, its skeleton was pure crystal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.67,0:59:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能一同找到埃克托 也许我们要到的是同样的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A distant cousin, perhaps. Maybe they, too, were sent to find Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.93,0:59:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们殊途同归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we're all searching for the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.47,0:59:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有别的解释了 - 总会有其它解释的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There is no other explanation. - There's always another explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.14,1:00:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,头骨是公元15世纪从埃克托偷来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skull was stolen from Akator in the 15th century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.48,1:00:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是谁…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever returns it …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.69,1:00:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,将其归还就能拥有无上的控制力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Returns it to the city temple will gain control over its powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.19,1:00:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听过这故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard that bedtime story before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.24,1:00:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是传说 你凭什么认为埃克托真正存在？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a legend. Why do you think Akator even existed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.37,1:00:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好拿这问题问问你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should ask your friend that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.00,1:00:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把教授带过来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.87,1:00:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定去过那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're certain he's been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.21,1:00:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯利？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.14,1:00:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 印第啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox, it's me, Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.31,1:00:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.35,1:00:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在装疯吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox, you're faking it, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.86,1:00:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过泪朦朦的双眼我看到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Through eyes that last I saw in tears …"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.86,1:00:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯 听我说 你是哈洛德·奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox, listen to me, pal. Your name is Harold Oxley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.95,1:00:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,出生于英国利兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were born in Leeds, England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.49,1:00:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩在芝加哥大学是同窗好友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I went to school together at the University of Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.33,1:00:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来不曾像今天这样好笑 我叫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were never this interesting. My name is …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.08,1:00:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫小亨利·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Henry Jones, Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.13,1:01:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把他怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.34,1:01:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没做 都怪那该死的颅骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't done a thing. It's the bloody skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.67,1:01:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士会带我们去埃克托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the divining rod that will lead us to Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.97,1:01:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们需要个翻译{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need someone to interpret him for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.47,1:01:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他精神状态看来不佳 希望你的精神状态比他好些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His mind, it seems, is quite weak. Let's hope yours is stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.93,1:01:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,水晶骷髅可以刺激大脑中尚不为人知的部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skull's crystal stimulates an undeveloped part of the human brain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.36,1:01:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开心灵通道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}opening a psychic channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.61,1:01:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯就是因为盯着它太久 才丧失了心智{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxley lost control of his mind by staring too long into its eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.78,1:01:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坚信 你也这么做就能和他沟通了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe you can get through to him after you have done the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.45,1:01:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个更好的办法 不如你来试试看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a better idea. You look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.29,1:01:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎骷髅头不是同每个人都有交流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skull does not speak to everyone, it seems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.79,1:01:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想必不害怕吧 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you're not afraid, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.46,1:01:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穷尽一生追寻的答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've spent your entire life searching for answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.13,1:01:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想这双眼之后的真相吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the truth behind those eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.30,1:01:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能世上还有数百个这样的骷髅头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be hundreds of skulls at Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.97,1:01:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁找到他们 谁就能掌握有史以来最强大的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever finds them will control the greatest natural force the world has ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.14,1:02:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类心智的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power over the mind of man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.77,1:02:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心哦 你可能真的会如愿以偿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, you might get exactly what you wish for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.48,1:02:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通常都心想事成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I usually do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.18,1:02:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.69,1:02:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过层层防线探知敌军秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To peer across the world and know the enemy's secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.44,1:02:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们的思想灌输给你们的领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To place our thoughts into the minds of your leaders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.78,1:02:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让老师教授真正的历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your teachers teach the true version of history, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.45,1:02:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们的战士听从我方指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your soldiers attack on our command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.36,1:02:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以神游世界 强大无比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be everywhere at once, more powerful than a whisper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.24,1:03:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在睡梦中即可改变世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}invading your dreams, thinking your thoughts for you while you sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.75,1:03:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会改变你的 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will change you, Dr. Jones, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.71,1:03:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人都会由内到外改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of you, from the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.59,1:03:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会变成我们的一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will turn you into us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.38,1:03:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而最好的一点 你察觉不到这种转变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the best part? You won't even know it's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.56,1:03:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,回归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.73,1:03:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,回归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.44,1:03:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.74,1:03:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 如果他死了 我们到不了那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough. If he dies, we can't get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.03,1:03:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.54,1:03:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.62,1:03:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, Jonesey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.42,1:03:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把我的鼻子打断了 - 告诉过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You broke my nose! - I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.93,1:04:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 你去和奥克斯谈话 然后带领我们去埃克托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! You will speak to Oxley and lead us to Akator, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.91,1:04:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,做梦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.52,1:04:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.15,1:04:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子 你还好吗？ - 这是我最糟的一学期了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right, kid? - They left my bike at the cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.86,1:04:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？ - 他们没把我的摩托车带来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but you're all right? - They left my bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.78,1:04:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 慢着 慢着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Whoa, whoa. Wait, wait, wait. Stop, stop, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.50,1:04:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了 什么都别给这些猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready. Don't give these pigs a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.46,1:04:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见他说什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.13,1:04:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 我还不想让他死呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly I have chosen the wrong pressure point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.72,1:04:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我可以找到个更敏感脆弱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I can find a more sensitive one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.57,1:04:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带出来！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.07,1:04:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手拿开 你们这些狗杂种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off me, you rotten Russki son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.48,1:04:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indiana Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.23,1:04:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是个扫把星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About time you showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.69,1:04:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈 - 甜心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.65,1:04:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,「妈妈」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mom"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.40,1:04:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.82,1:05:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说我了 你没受伤吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about me. Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.99,1:05:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「妈妈」？ - 年轻人 我明明告诉过你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Mom"? - Young man, I specifically told you …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.33,1:05:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要来这 - 玛丽安是你妈妈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- not to come here. - Marion is your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.00,1:05:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你信里可没讲 电话里也没讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never wrote that. You never said that in any phone calls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.12,1:05:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽安·瑞文伍德是你妈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marion Ravenwood is your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.37,1:05:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 印第 生个儿子没那么难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, Indy, it's not that hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.67,1:05:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我的意思是 我从来没认为你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, I just never thought …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.67,1:05:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你离开之后还活得挺好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have a life after you left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.34,1:05:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可不是我的意思 - 生活得很滋润{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not what I meant. - A damn good life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.93,1:05:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就好 - 生活得好的不能再好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, that's fine. - A damn good, really good life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.60,1:05:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, so have I! - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.18,1:05:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是生活在人类遗址里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still leaving a trail of human wreckage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.06,1:05:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是退休了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or have you retired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.56,1:05:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这样问？想约我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You looking for a date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.14,1:05:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,约谁都不约你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With anybody but you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.48,1:05:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 琼斯博士 你会帮我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dr. Jones, you will help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.11,1:05:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,说行就可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple "yes" will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.65,1:05:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽安 你为什么跑去让人家绑架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Marion, you had to go and get yourself kidnapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.20,1:05:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没做什么好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like you did any better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.95,1:05:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是老样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old, same old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.95,1:05:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小亨利·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Jones, Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.83,1:05:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小亨利·琼斯 - 没错 是我 听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry Jones, Jr. … - That's right, Ox. Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.42,1:05:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手放在金钥匙上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To lay their just hands on that Golden Key …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.51,1:06:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开永恒之殿的大门 - 什么宫殿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "that ope's the Palace of Eternity." - Palace of …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.43,1:06:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说过这句话 什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from Milton. He's said it before. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.01,1:06:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯 你得告诉我们怎么去埃克托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox, you got to tell us how to get to Akator …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.60,1:06:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然他们会杀了玛丽安的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they're gonna kill Marion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.10,1:06:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过泪朦朦的双眼看见金色图像重现…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Through eyes that last I saw in tears, here in death's dream kingdom …"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.52,1:06:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛德 他们会杀掉安不勒的小女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold, they're gonna kill Abner's little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.15,1:06:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们怎么去那儿 我需要详细…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to tell us how to get there. We need …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.12,1:06:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我张纸 随便什么能写字的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me paper. Something to write with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.08,1:06:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿张纸来！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.09,1:06:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他画下来 早该料到这一点的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autowriting! I should have seen this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.76,1:06:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小亨利·琼斯 - 没错 奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry Jones, Jr. - Right. That's right, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.47,1:06:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,往下落三次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times it drops. The way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.40,1:06:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 3次… - 象形文字记载？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three times … - Pictographs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.61,1:07:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,象形文字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ideograms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.74,1:07:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 奥克斯 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, Ox. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.55,1:07:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.39,1:07:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我啊 奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.35,1:07:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是马特 看着我 看着我 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Mutt, Ox. Hey, look at me. Look at me. It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.56,1:07:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.27,1:07:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,弯曲的线条绝对代表河水 紧闭的双眼代表睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wavy lines mean water, of course. Closed eyes mean sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.28,1:07:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中闪烁的太阳表示时刻 时期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun with the arc over the sky stands for time, duration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.66,1:07:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,「现在」这个词表示「直到」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word "now" is "until."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.33,1:07:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧挨的两条蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These two close together, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.66,1:07:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,昂起身子是一个神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the horizon and the snake, mean one thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.17,1:07:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,地平线代表世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The horizon stood for the world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.25,1:08:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个代表「巨大的」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it didn't mean the Earth. It meant big, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.84,1:08:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,长眠于巨蛇下的大河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The water sleeps until the great snake."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.68,1:08:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不仅仅是图画 而是方位 给我张地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These aren't just drawings, they're directions. Get me a map!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.72,1:08:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.10,1:08:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大蛇是亚马孙河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great snake is the Amazon, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.14,1:08:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡觉？哪条河会睡觉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but "sleep, " what water sleeps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.24,1:08:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 索拿河 葡萄牙语里是「睡眠」的意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here! Sono. The Portuguese word for "sleep."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.74,1:08:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 的确是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, good. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.03,1:08:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,色法罗河在此处转弯 与索拿河交汇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to follow this curve of the Sono …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.96,1:08:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在东南方与亚马逊交汇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}down to where it meets the Amazon to the southeast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.33,1:08:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的我就不确定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.21,1:08:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,王国 梦境 眼泪 双眼… 不知到底什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kingdom of dreams, tears and eyes … I have no idea what he means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.71,1:08:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也可能指的是路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be the route, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.80,1:08:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿人烟罕至 属于卡锐兵平原{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a completely unexplored part of the canopy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.56,1:08:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快 快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.23,1:09:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们到底在干嘛 小子？ - 他们会杀死我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kid, what the hell are we doing, kid? - They were going to kill us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.48,1:09:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许吧 - 得有人采取措施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, maybe. - Somebody had to do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.82,1:09:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其它的措施还好些 - 至少我有个计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something else would have been good. - At least I got a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.20,1:09:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可理喻 哈洛德 跟上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is intolerable. Harold, for God's sake, keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.75,1:09:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.83,1:09:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别过来 - 停下 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay back! - Stop! Stop! Stop! Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.75,1:09:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱动会形成空间 导致下沉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving makes space, space will make you sink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.42,1:09:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把腿拔出来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think I can get out if I can just …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.76,1:09:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 往外拔只会更糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! You're pulling against a vacuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.43,1:09:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,先冷静下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like trying to lift a car. Just stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.34,1:09:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我不慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.60,1:09:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？流沙？ - 我冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? Quicksand? - I'm calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.97,1:09:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不对 是干沙 - 我在下沉 但我冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's a dry sand pit. - I'm sinking, but I'm calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.06,1:09:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,流沙混合了沙 水和泥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quicksand is a mix of sand, mud and water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.14,1:09:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,基于粘性 它并不像人们想得那么危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And depending on the viscosity, it's not as dangerous as people sometimes think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.74,1:09:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在老天的份上 琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Pete's sake, Jones, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.48,1:09:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是在学校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not in school!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.15,1:09:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 没什么好担心的 除非…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. There's nothing to worry about unless there's a …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.94,1:09:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A void collapse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.11,1:09:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿东西救你们出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go get something to pull you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.49,1:09:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯 别傻站着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox, don't just sit there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.45,1:09:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的面上 老兄 找人来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, man, go get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.04,1:10:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命 - 帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help? - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.21,1:10:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.79,1:10:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找人帮忙 去呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.25,1:10:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特可能有些冲动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutt can be a little impetuous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.67,1:10:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不算是世上最坏的性质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the worst quality in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.80,1:10:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手上举 那小子回来的时候 抓住递来的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your arms above the surface. When the kid comes back, grab on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.80,1:10:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 印第 他是… - 他是个好孩子 玛丽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Indy, he … - He's a good kid, Marion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.97,1:10:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再拿学习唠叨他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get off his back about school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.73,1:10:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马特 我是说… - 他救了大伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mutt, I mean … - Not everybody's cut out for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.90,1:10:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他名叫亨利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Henry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.65,1:10:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 好名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry. Good name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.27,1:10:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.82,1:10:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.49,1:10:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利·琼斯 三世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Jones the Third.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.53,1:10:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没逼他完成学业？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell didn't you make him finish school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.50,1:10:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 抓好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, grab on! Grab it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.25,1:10:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓稳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.79,1:10:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 老妈 拉 使劲儿拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Mom! Pull, pull, pull, pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.05,1:10:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.26,1:10:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓着呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.35,1:10:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住 - 抓住那蛇 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab it. - Just grab it, Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.18,1:11:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只吃老鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rat snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.81,1:11:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吃老鼠的蛇没这么大 - 这只就这么大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rat snakes aren't that big. - Well, this one is, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.85,1:11:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没毒的 抓住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even poisonous. Now grab on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.52,1:11:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去拿别的东西 - 拿什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go get something else. - Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.15,1:11:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳子之类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a rope or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.98,1:11:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿可找不到绳子 抓住蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no Sears and Roebuck here! Grab the snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.57,1:11:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许我就能触到底了 - 不会到底的 抓着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I can touch the bottom. - There's no bottom. Now grab it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.87,1:11:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脚尖已触到底了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think I can feel it with my feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.87,1:11:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓着蛇 - 别那样喊它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab the snake! - Stop calling it that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.58,1:11:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是条蛇 要我怎么叫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a snake! What do you want me to call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.37,1:11:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫「绳子」 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say "rope." - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.33,1:11:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,说「抓住绳子」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "grab the rope."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.50,1:11:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓着绳子 - 抓着绳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab the rope! - Grab the rope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.13,1:11:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tight. It's slimy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.92,1:11:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.47,1:11:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 把它扔远点好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of that thing, will you, Son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.73,1:11:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid of snakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.94,1:11:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个疯老头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are one crazy old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.78,1:11:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下一步准备干什么啊 琼斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to do everything the hard way, Jonesey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.08,1:12:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮啊 奥克斯 谢谢啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work, Ox. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.83,1:12:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,找人帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.82,1:12:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 他是英国人 我老爸是皇家空军飞行员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, he was British. My dad was an RAF pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.12,1:12:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是战斗英雄 不是什么大学老师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a war hero, not some schoolteacher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.50,1:12:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 甜心 柯林是你的继父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sweetheart. Colin was your stepfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.29,1:12:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你3个月大时 我才和他约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We started dating when you were three months old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.17,1:12:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.63,1:12:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 柯林？是那个柯林·威廉姆斯吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Colin? As in Colin Williams? You …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.01,1:13:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他结婚了？是我介绍你们认识的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You married him? I introduced you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.64,1:13:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管我最后嫁给谁呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you gave up your vote on who I married …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.81,1:13:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼前一周你和我分手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you decided to break it off a week before the wedding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.81,1:13:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩都清楚 咱们的婚姻不会幸福的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we both knew, Marion, it wasn't going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.23,1:13:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不知道呢 不然怎么没跟我说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know that. Why didn't you ever talk to me about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.77,1:13:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为每一次吵架都是你赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we never had an argument I won!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.73,1:13:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回不上嘴可不是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault if you can't keep up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.57,1:13:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤了你的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to hurt you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.82,1:13:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天慈悲 闭嘴吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For love of God, shut the hell up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.53,1:13:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就从来没觉得奇怪为何几年前奥克斯不理你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you ever wonder years ago why Ox stopped talking to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.62,1:13:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他恨你离我而去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hated that you ran away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.41,1:13:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个别吵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you two just stop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.91,1:13:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 玛丽安 别让小孩子看见爹妈吵架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Marion, let's not let the kid see mom and dad fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.58,1:13:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是我爹 明白吗？ - 我是你爹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not my dad, okay? - You bet I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.84,1:13:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got news for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.25,1:13:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得回学校完成学业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna go back and finish school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.34,1:13:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? What happened to, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.59,1:13:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There's not a damn thing wrong with it, kid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.18,1:13:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「做自己喜欢的事」之类的话了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and don't let anybody else tell you any different"? You don't remember saying that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.89,1:13:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在我知道你是我儿子之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was before I was your father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.68,1:13:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你才不是我爹！- 没错 他是你爹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not my father! - Oh, yes, he is your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.22,1:13:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该把孩子的事告诉我 玛丽安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have told me about the kid, Marion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.81,1:13:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a right to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.14,1:13:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,分手后你无影无踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You vanished after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.89,1:13:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有写信啊 - 一年之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wrote. - A year later!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.52,1:13:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到信时 马特已经出生 我也结婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By then, Mutt was born and I was married!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.40,1:13:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你何必现在费事告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you bothering to tell me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.28,1:14:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我认为我们快死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I thought we were gonna die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.70,1:14:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,死不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.42,1:14:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.05,1:14:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.73,1:14:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢肯定我不是你的唯一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I wasn't the only one to go on with my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.53,1:14:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年来你一定有不少红颜知己吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must've been plenty of women for you over the years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.57,1:14:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有几个 但是全有一样的毛病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There were a few, but they all had the same problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.87,1:14:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么毛病？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.83,1:14:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们不是你 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't you, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.02,1:15:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要抢在他们之前找到骷髅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get Oxley back, get our hands on that skull …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.19,1:15:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后送到埃克托 抓住方向盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get to Akator before they do. Grab the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.12,1:15:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打算怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he gonna do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.33,1:15:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不觉得他有那么长远的计划 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think he plans that far ahead. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.59,1:15:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往右边挪挪好吗 儿子？ - 别叫我「儿子」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scooch over, will you, Son? - Don't call me "son." Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.05,1:15:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是我 就堵住耳朵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd cover my ears if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.81,1:15:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头 低头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck! Duck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.82,1:16:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.70,1:16:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个博士身边停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up next to that duck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.79,1:16:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,小亨利·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Jones, Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.26,1:16:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.36,1:16:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个带走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.85,1:16:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.33,1:16:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住他！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.61,1:16:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 来这辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.59,1:17:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.77,1:17:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯拿着骷髅呢 玛丽安握好方向盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox has got the skull. Marion, take the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.81,1:17:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又让她开车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not fair. She drove the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.23,1:17:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别孩子气 找武器和他们打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a child. Find something to fight with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.08,1:17:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.68,1:17:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琼斯 - 你好啊 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jonesey! - Hi, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.00,1:18:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 印第 印第 - 闭嘴 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Indy. Indy! Indy! - Shut up! Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.22,1:18:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这愚蠢的狗杂种 我是中情局的 - 中情局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You stupid son of a bitch! I'm CIA. - CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.35,1:18:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要你死 就像在柏林时一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost screamed it at you in the tent. I said, "Just like Berlin."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.06,1:18:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在柏林干嘛 兄弟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were we in Berlin, mate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.10,1:18:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 双面间谍 - 把骷髅头扔给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Double agents! - The skull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.02,1:18:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住那包袱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw me the skull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.67,1:19:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意姿势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riposte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.30,1:19:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,双脚别站那么开 注意姿势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on your front foot. Riposte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.51,1:19:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是比赛 老妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a match, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.38,1:19:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打架就是个新手 打得快 输得也快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight like a young man, eager to begin, quick to finish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.88,1:19:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特 别和她纠缠了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutt, disengage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.92,1:20:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到骷髅了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, I got the skull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.51,1:20:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扔过来 - 扔过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Throw the bag! Throw it! - Throw the bag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.30,1:20:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 枪 - 小心枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gun! - Gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.31,1:21:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么看 她就要逃走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at, Daddy-o? She's getting away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.93,1:22:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那边去{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.04,1:22:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.07,1:23:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do svidanya, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.26,1:23:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.28,1:23:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拐弯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.44,1:24:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 食人蚁 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Siafu. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.85,1:24:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃人的蚂蚁 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big damn ants! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.20,1:24:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去河边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run to the river!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.42,1:24:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.18,1:24:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着骷髅往河边跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the river!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.94,1:25:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 快快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump in! Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.83,1:25:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 那儿有悬崖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, there's a cliff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.74,1:28:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琼斯 快来！- 琼斯 上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jonesey, come on! - Get in, Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.85,1:28:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈 停下 - 快减速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom, stop. - Mom, slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.06,1:28:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下 亲爱的 - 快减速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, stop. - Slow down, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.31,1:28:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要开下悬崖了 - 我自有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna go off the cliff. - That's the idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.06,1:28:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但不是什么好办法 我来 - 相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bad idea. Give me the wheel. - Trust me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.73,1:28:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,开慢点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.76,1:29:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再也不要那么干了 - 好的 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't ever do that again. - Yes, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.53,1:29:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,往下落三次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times it drops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.45,1:29:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒车 转过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverse. Put it in reverse! Full reverse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.12,1:29:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在尝试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying! I'm trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.18,1:29:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去的路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.65,1:29:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆地上的那条道 你是说从陆地上走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means by land. He came by land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.32,1:29:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往下落三次？ - 往下落三次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three times it drops? - Three times it drops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.65,1:30:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.11,1:30:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的意思是第一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.53,1:30:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是第二次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.01,1:30:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.21,1:31:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？松手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? Babe? Let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.97,1:31:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过泪朦朦的双眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Through eyes that last I saw in tears."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.01,1:31:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见金色图像重现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The golden vision reappears!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.90,1:31:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,金子 告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold. I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.98,1:31:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过双眼…泪朦朦的双眼 我们得穿过瀑布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through eyes … Through eyes in tears. We got to go through that waterfall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.65,1:31:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须归还骷髅 我去吧 其它人不必来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skull has to be returned. I'll do it. Nobody else has to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.57,1:31:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.83,1:31:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只能给我们带来麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's brought us nothing but trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.79,1:31:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看把他变成什么样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what it did to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.33,1:31:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须得去归还 - 为什么是你去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to return it. - Why you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.59,1:31:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它告诉我要去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it told me to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.43,1:31:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧克斯人 他们的图腾 壁画 - 欧克斯 别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ochre, iron oxide, charcoal. - Oxy, stay with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.94,1:31:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有多久的历史了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.65,1:32:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,四五千年前的文明 与金字塔一样古老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four or five thousand years. Old as the pyramids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.53,1:32:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,崇拜太阳神的人 和埃及人一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, sun worshippers, like the Egyptians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.62,1:32:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新鲜的 刚刚有人用过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is fresh. These were just used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.80,1:32:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多的崇拜者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More worshippers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.59,1:32:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但他们不崇拜太阳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that's not the sun they're worshipping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.98,1:32:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone came …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.61,1:32:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,农耕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and taught the Ugha farming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.86,1:32:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,灌溉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irrigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.71,1:33:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯 怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.44,1:33:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你的意思 奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I understand, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.11,1:33:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone came?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.59,1:33:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那骷髅头和壁画中的一模一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they the same?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.18,1:33:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止一个 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were more. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.93,1:33:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共有十三个 围成一圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirteen in a circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.07,1:34:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,路在哪儿 奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show us the way, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.45,1:35:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走 快 快 - 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. Go, go, go! Run! Run, go! - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.99,1:35:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.82,1:35:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小琼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.49,1:35:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.95,1:35:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到过这里 怎么逃脱的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were here before. How did you get past them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.63,1:35:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 麦克 起来 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Mac. Come on! Come on, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.51,1:35:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 来 来 奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.68,1:36:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手放在金钥匙上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To lay their just hands on that Golden Key …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.18,1:36:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开永恒宫殿的大门 - 来吧 奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "that ope's the Palace of Eternity." - Come on, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.89,1:36:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样儿的 你是好样儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did good, Ox. You did good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.38,1:36:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金之城 那黄金在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}City of gold. So where's all the gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.84,1:36:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这地方有多老了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the state of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.80,1:36:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢透了 真是浪费我的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a stupid legend. What a waste of my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.68,1:36:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯从前来过这里 但他没法子进入神殿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox was here before, but he couldn't get into the temple, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.56,1:36:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就又把骷髅送了回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he took the skull back to the cemetery, where he found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.19,1:36:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的双手放在纯金钥匙上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To lay their just hands on that Golden Key …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.69,1:36:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来打开永恒宫殿的大门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"that ope's the Palace of Eternity."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.07,1:36:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,宫殿金钥匙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key that ope's the palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.90,1:36:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,石碑！这石碑就是钥匙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The obelisk. The obelisk is the key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.08,1:37:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯 你找什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking for, Ox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.63,1:37:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.26,1:37:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在监牢里才想明白 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You figured this out in your cell, didn't you, Professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.89,1:37:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我试一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.74,1:37:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.28,1:37:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去搬你自己的石块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.18,1:38:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.06,1:38:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.98,1:38:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 奥克斯 快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up! Move! Ox, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.02,1:39:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,再快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster! Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.20,1:39:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.86,1:39:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not good. Move, Ox! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.78,1:39:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! Quick! Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.04,1:39:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这样 我讨厌这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this! I don't like it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.75,1:39:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈 快点 - 琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom, come on! - Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.06,1:39:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞丢了 他把骷髅搞丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dropped it. He dropped the skull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.48,1:39:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.07,1:39:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.87,1:39:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克斯 你没受伤吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ox, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.73,1:39:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.71,1:40:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 咱们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.59,1:40:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.00,1:41:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于看见点值钱的东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's more like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.05,1:41:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,各个历史时期的文物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are artifacts from every era of early history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.05,1:41:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,马其顿文明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Macedonian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.34,1:41:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏美尔文明 - 这简直就是天然的收藏展览{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sumerian. - This place is the mother lode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.01,1:41:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴比伦文明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Etruscan. Babylonian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.06,1:41:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上的每个博物馆都会爱死这地方的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't a museum in the world that wouldn't sell its soul for this lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.27,1:41:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,早期的埃及文明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early Egyptian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.44,1:41:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多许多博物馆 成千上百个 琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dozens of museums. Hundreds of them, Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.27,1:41:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,收藏家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collectors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.20,1:41:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是考古学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were archeologists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.78,1:42:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么打开它？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we open it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.91,1:42:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它还回去 奥克斯 我承诺过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give it back, Ox. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.49,1:44:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再永远等待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more forever waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.50,1:44:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.92,1:44:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起了 琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Jonesey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.93,1:44:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底为谁工作？三重特务？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you, a triple agent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.68,1:44:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里 说我是双重特务 不过是谎话而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I just lied about being a double.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.35,1:44:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.19,1:44:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然在等待迷失的那个回归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still waiting for the return of the one who was lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.20,1:44:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然作为个体存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are a hive mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.08,1:44:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,却心灵相通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One being physically separate, but with a collective consciousness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.54,1:44:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,合而为一力量会更大 远胜于个体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More powerful together than they can ever be apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.81,1:45:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下 他们能够告诉什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine what they could tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.52,1:45:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.31,1:45:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,建造神殿的人也想不出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither could the humans that built this temple, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.89,1:45:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不用说是你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and neither can you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.06,1:45:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我吧 琼斯博士 你在这儿会收到一份礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belief, Dr. Jones, is a gift you have yet to receive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.11,1:45:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的同情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sympathies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.74,1:45:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我相信 所以才到这地下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I believe, sister. That's why I'm down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.19,1:45:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛雅语 他在说玛雅语 - 他在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mayan. He's speaking Mayan. - What does he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.53,1:46:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 非常感激 他想要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he's grateful and he wants …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.32,1:46:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.79,1:46:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要给我们一份礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants to give us a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.46,1:46:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,丰厚的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.63,1:46:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你所知道的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me everything you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.80,1:46:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道一切 我想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know everything. I want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.81,1:46:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预感不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a bad feeling about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.99,1:46:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.16,1:46:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.10,1:47:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是什么东西？航天员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they? Spacemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.22,1:47:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要回自己的空间去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interdimensional beings, in point of fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.73,1:47:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于清醒了 奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.95,1:48:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.70,1:48:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,通往另一个空间的通道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A portal! A pathway to another dimension!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.96,1:48:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才不要去呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we want to go that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.10,1:48:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道 我想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know. I want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.60,1:48:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我准备好了 我想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. I'm ready. I want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.53,1:48:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 麦克 快来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac! Mac! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.70,1:48:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.29,1:48:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿了 现在就走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac, damn it, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.85,1:49:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.18,1:49:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.60,1:49:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.69,1:49:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,往上爬啊 麦克 我一个人拉不动你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your legs, Mac. I can't do it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.41,1:49:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 小琼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.28,1:49:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.96,1:49:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.67,1:49:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖上它 快盖上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover it. Cover it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.32,1:50:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.48,1:50:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.25,1:50:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.10,1:52:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那痕迹像朵花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a broom to their footprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.19,1:52:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们上哪儿去了？太空？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did they go? Space?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.40,1:52:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是去了太空 而是空间的缝隙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not into space. Into the space between spaces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.37,1:53:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.75,1:53:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的黄金城在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why this legend of a city of gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.75,1:53:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在古语中黄金这个词可译成「宝藏」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ugha word for gold translates as "treasure."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.93,1:53:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但宝物指的并非是黄金 而是知识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But their treasure wasn't gold. It was knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.93,1:53:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,知识才是他们的宝物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowledge was their treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.86,1:53:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我们就坐在这儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? We're just going to sit here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.24,1:53:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 雨林的夜晚来的早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night falls quick in the jungle, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.99,1:53:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想摸黑翻山越岭吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to climb down the mountain in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.99,1:53:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.50,1:53:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能 跟着我走 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can. Who's coming with me? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.08,1:53:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不坐一会儿呢 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stick around, Junior?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.09,1:53:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 你为什么不走呢 老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Why didn't you, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.14,1:54:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.22,1:54:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.52,1:54:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爷爷不定在哪儿偷笑呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere your grandpa is laughing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.05,1:54:31.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小亨利·琼斯教授 副院长）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.79,1:54:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 棒极了 把字写大点儿 再大点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marvelous! Perfect! Make the letters bigger, much bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.22,1:54:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小亨利·琼斯和玛丽安·瑞文伍德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Jones, Jr., and Marion Ravenwood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.06,1:54:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你二人愿意在此神圣仪式上宣布今后共结连理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}insomuch in that you two have agreed to live together in holy matrimony, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.15,1:55:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣誓彼此珍爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have promised your love for each other by these vows …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.45,1:55:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,执对方之手 交换戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the joining of your hands and the giving of these rings, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.87,1:55:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在宣布你们结成夫妻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now declare you to be husband and wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.66,1:55:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,奉上帝之意结合 永不分离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whom God hath put together, let no one tear asunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.46,1:55:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生有多少时光都在等待中虚度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How much of human life is lost in waiting!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.54,1:55:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.88,1:55:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吻新娘子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may kiss your bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.57,1:55:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错 亨利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Henry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.36,1:55:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Ox.{\r}
